1. Find bookings whose seat number is greater than the average seat number of that passenger (Correlated Subquery).

SQL> SELECT passenger_id, seat_no
  2  FROM Booking B
  3  WHERE seat_no >
  4        (SELECT AVG(seat_no)
  5         FROM Booking
  6         WHERE passenger_id = B.passenger_id);

PASSENGER_ID    SEAT_NO
------------ ----------
           2          5
           2          5

